---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Patient Consent & Disclaimer - Dentist For You"
  description="Important consent and medical disclaimer information for Dentist For You patients and website visitors."
>
  <main>
    <LegalPage
      title="Patient Consent & Disclaimer"
      description="Please read this before booking, messaging us, or relying on information on this website."
    >
      <section>
        <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
        <p>
          Content on this website — including treatment descriptions, photos, videos, testimonials, and any cost or timeline estimates —
          is for general education only. It is not a diagnosis, prescription, or personalised treatment advice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Clinical consent</h2>
        <p>
          Before treatment at the clinic, you (or a parent/guardian) will be asked to provide informed consent after we explain
          the proposed care, alternatives, risks, and expected outcomes. Website forms do not replace that process.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Results vary</h2>
        <p>
          Smile outcomes depend on oral health, anatomy, habits, and how closely instructions are followed.
          Before-and-after examples and testimonials show individual experiences and are not a guarantee of similar results.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Emergency care</h2>
        <p>
          This website and WhatsApp enquiries are not for medical emergencies. If you have severe pain, swelling, bleeding, or trauma,
          seek urgent care at an appropriate medical or dental facility.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Messaging and forms</h2>
        <p>
          By sending a contact or booking request, you consent to us contacting you by phone, WhatsApp, or email about your enquiry.
          Avoid sending highly sensitive health details over WhatsApp unless you are comfortable doing so.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Photographs and media</h2>
        <p>
          Clinic photos and videos on this site are used with permission where individuals are identifiable.
          Do not copy or republish patient-related imagery without our written consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>
          Discuss consent and treatment concerns with our team in person, or contact
          <a href="tel:+919935027027">+91 99350 27027</a> ·
          <a href="mailto:hello@dentalforyou.com">hello@dentalforyou.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </LegalPage>
  </main>
</Layout>
